# um-texts 1
=== ALLOD gipat
Gipath
Gipath is a desolate land which stands alone. It is populated mainly by Goblins, Orcs and other creatures hostile to humans. The only human settlement is very small and constantly under threat of tragedy.

=== ALLOD ingos
Ingos
Ingos is part of the Canian empire; but its territory is quite large and thinly populated, so tribes of other races still inhabit this land. It is divided into several provinces, each of which is ruled by a governor supported by guards assigned from the capital city. But Ingo's residents still enjoy considerable freedom and they are very independent, being not very well-known for their willingness to comply with the authorities.

=== ALLOD suslanger
Suslanger
Suslanger is a part of the Khadaganian empire. Its territory is not particularly large and the inhabitable, arable area is even smaller. The river which  has gouged out a deep canyon throughout the ages flows into the lake and is practically the only significant source of water. To expand the farming lands, people have to build dams and irrigation canals. Khadaganian authorities are cruel and ruthless. Numerous guards mete out severe punishment for even the smallest deviation from the Emperor's decrees, while spies and eavesdroppers report on every person whom they find suspicious.

